WEBVTT

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.080
What should I do?

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:26.470
Since Meklord Emperor took 
Stardust, how can I win?

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:33.830
By absorbing Stardust Dragon, Meklord 
Emperor Wisel has 5000 attack points.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:38.410
I took your Synchro Monster as an offering!

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.140
Why?

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:44.710
Why couldn't I Accel Synchro?

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:48.460
Accel Synchro!

00:00:51.420 --> 00:00:52.220
What?

00:00:52.760 --> 00:00:56.420
I don't have the power to defeat him?

00:00:59.330 --> 00:01:04.460
Yusei couldn't achieve Clear Mind 
because his heart is in chaos.

00:01:05.260 --> 00:01:08.340
That's why he failed to Accel Synchro.

00:01:11.520 --> 00:01:15.280
Foolish human, kneel before Meklord Emperor!

00:01:15.280 --> 00:01:17.970
Accept your destiny!

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.830
Yusei...

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.570
Don't worry.

00:01:56.550 --> 00:01:57.900
What's that light?

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.400
What's happening?

00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.110
What's wrong, Jack?

00:02:03.650 --> 00:02:04.660
Ouch!

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:07.070
What's wrong, Ruka?  Crow?

00:02:07.430 --> 00:02:09.770
I feel his pain.

00:02:10.150 --> 00:02:12.540
He's battling on the edge!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.070
Are you okay?

00:02:15.270 --> 00:02:17.730
I'm fine, Haruka.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:24.880
Yusei is risking his life to 
fight and protect this city.

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:43.760
I can't defeat Meklord Emperor unless 
I get my stolen Stardust back!

00:02:44.670 --> 00:02:46.890
But how can I do that?

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.300
Riding Duels.

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:53.410
These duels evolved in the world of speed.

00:02:53.670 --> 00:03:00.280
The people with the legendary marks who 
risked their lives were known as 5D's.

00:03:15.310 --> 00:03:21.450
Reach out your hand and 
grab a bright tomorrow

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:31.560
Soar in the infinite skies   BELIEVE IN NEXUS

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:37.800
No one can stop my wild impulses

00:03:38.160 --> 00:03:43.770
My hand sweats as the battle 
intensifies  This Heart Beat

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:49.540
I can't avoid this fearsome battle

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:55.110
I don't want it to end here  Go For It!!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:04:01.490
Stand up  Don't tremble in fear alone

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:07.290
Remember that you have 
friends waiting for you

00:04:07.530 --> 00:04:13.600
I'm not scared and I'll never give 
up, no matter how powerful the enemy

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:19.900
With real courage, I'll never lose

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:49.970
Accel Synchro!Arise!Shooting Star Dragon!

00:04:55.330 --> 00:04:58.600
Meklord Emperor Wisel gains more power!

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:01.330
I activate the trap Wise A3!

00:05:01.930 --> 00:05:05.180
I send Wisel Attack on 
my field to the graveyard

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:08.480
to Special Summon Wisel 
Attack 3 from my hand!

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.720
It gained more attack points?

00:05:23.720 --> 00:05:25.670
Not just attack points!

00:05:25.670 --> 00:05:27.670
Due to Wisel Attack 3's effect...

00:05:27.670 --> 00:05:30.380
...Meklord Emperor Wisel 
deals piercing damage

00:05:30.380 --> 00:05:32.880
when it attacks a monster 
in defense position.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:33.680
What?

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:36.890
Formula Synchron has 1500 defense points.

00:05:36.890 --> 00:05:39.780
You have 3300 life points.

00:05:40.350 --> 00:05:45.820
If you take a 5400-point attack, your life 
points will become 0 due to piercing damage.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:48.350
Go, Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.300
I activate the trap D2 Shield!

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:57.720
My defense position monster's defense 
points are doubled until the End Phase!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:22.560
Even though you have a few life points 
left, you're barely surviving.

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.660
I activate Skiel Carrier 5's effect!

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:31.350
Since your monster was destroyed in battle, 
you take 300 more points of damage.

00:06:38.100 --> 00:06:40.080
I activate D2 Shield's effect!

00:06:40.080 --> 00:06:43.820
When the target monster is 
destroyed, I draw one card!

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:49.410
What a glorious dance for a bug, Yusei!

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.750
At this rate, I'll lose!

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:55.150
You're going to keep dancing.

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:57.960
It's not just you.

00:06:57.960 --> 00:07:01.600
Destiny keeps everyone dancing.

00:07:02.430 --> 00:07:06.200
A neverending dance since 
the beginning of history.

00:07:06.390 --> 00:07:07.500
What?

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.240
Yusei, have you ever seen a bee dance?

00:07:18.560 --> 00:07:19.570
A bee dance?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.920
That's right.  Bees dance beautifully.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:27.030
That dance lets others 
know where to find honey.

00:07:27.030 --> 00:07:30.260
They think that they're dancing 
of their own free will,

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:35.300
but they're simply repeating 
actions dictated by destiny.

00:07:36.130 --> 00:07:37.210
What are you trying to say?

00:07:37.410 --> 00:07:39.670
That you're the same.

00:07:39.670 --> 00:07:44.640
Humans should follow their destiny 
and continue to dance until they die.

00:07:45.220 --> 00:07:47.140
I end my turn!

00:07:47.140 --> 00:07:50.780
Perform a dance more beautiful 
than the bees, Yusei.

00:07:51.980 --> 00:07:55.170
I won't let you do whatever you want!

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:56.540
My turn!

00:07:58.440 --> 00:08:01.860
I don't have anything in 
my hand to turn the tables.

00:08:04.660 --> 00:08:09.810
I remove 7 Speed Counters 
to draw one more card!

00:08:10.170 --> 00:08:13.910
I summon Necro Linker from 
my hand in defense position!

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:20.010
I set one card and end my turn.

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:23.540
All you can do is grovel?

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.990
Then I'll make you dance using 
Meklord Emperor's power!

00:08:28.150 --> 00:08:31.540
Meklord Emperor's terror is immeasurable.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:38.220
But I must survive until I get Stardust back!

00:08:39.080 --> 00:08:40.340
My turn!

00:08:41.240 --> 00:08:43.930
I activate the trap Wise T3!

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:47.300
By sending Wisel Top on 
my field to the graveyard,

00:08:47.480 --> 00:08:50.710
I can Special Summon 
Wisel Top 3 from my hand!

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.940
It gained more attack points!

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:07.260
Meklord Emperor has infinite potential!

00:09:07.260 --> 00:09:08.020
Battle!

00:09:08.020 --> 00:09:11.060
Meklord Emperor Wisel attacks Necro Linker!

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:19.290
I activate the trap Scrap-Iron Scarecrow.

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:22.490
It activates when your monster attacks!

00:09:22.490 --> 00:09:24.200
It negates your attack!

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:27.480
But Meklord Emperor has another effect.

00:09:27.480 --> 00:09:29.700
I activate Wisel Top 3's effect!

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:34.910
Once per turn, your spell or trap card's 
activation is negated and destroyed.

00:09:35.320 --> 00:09:37.790
I'll destroy Scrap-Iron Scarecrow.

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:39.090
What?

00:09:42.530 --> 00:09:46.250
All your strategies are worthless 
against Meklord Emperor.

00:09:46.500 --> 00:09:48.340
You're weaker than a bee!

00:09:48.340 --> 00:09:50.390
I'll destroy you and your monster!

00:09:56.820 --> 00:10:00.360
When a card on my field is destroyed 
during the Battle Phase...

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:05.690
...I send Arbitrator from my hand to 
the graveyard to end the Battle Phase!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:08.550
What?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.390
A two-stage defense.

00:10:11.390 --> 00:10:12.610
I end my turn.

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:20.240
I managed to survive this turn, but Accel 
Synchro is the only way to defeat Meklord Emperor.

00:10:21.610 --> 00:10:23.210
Deck, answer me.

00:10:24.140 --> 00:10:27.140
I need a way to get Stardust 
back from Meklord Emperor!

00:10:27.510 --> 00:10:29.050
My turn!

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:32.700
Good!

00:10:33.300 --> 00:10:35.210
I summon Rescue Warrior!

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:43.390
Battle!  Rescue Warrior attacks 
Meklord Emperor Wisel!

00:10:47.330 --> 00:10:50.600
You're attacking Meklord Emperor 
with 1600 attack points?

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:55.220
When Rescue Warrior attacks, 
I take 0 battle damage!

00:10:57.580 --> 00:11:02.500
I don't know what you're planning, but 
you'll take Skiel Carrier 5's effect!

00:11:02.740 --> 00:11:07.840
When I destroy a monster in battle, 
you take 300 points of damage!

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:14.150
But when Rescue Warrior 
is destroyed in battle,

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:18.750
I regain control of my 
card that's on your field!

00:11:21.460 --> 00:11:22.180
What?

00:11:22.360 --> 00:11:25.360
Stardust Dragon is free of its restraints!

00:11:25.360 --> 00:11:27.890
Return to me, Stardust!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:01.580
You're back, Stardust.

00:12:02.560 --> 00:12:04.910
Meklord Emperor's attack 
points also decrease!

00:12:09.940 --> 00:12:13.020
I activate Necro Linker's effect.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:17.500
I release this monster to Special Summon 
a Tuner Monster from my graveyard!

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:20.050
Resurrect, Formula Synchron!

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:27.730
Due to Formula Synchron's 
effect, I draw one card.

00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:31.940
When Necro Linker's effect 
Special Summons a Tuner Monster,

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:33.740
it can't be used as Synchro 
Material this turn.

00:12:34.300 --> 00:12:35.430
I end my turn!

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:42.810
You set up your tricks, but 
you couldn't do anything.

00:12:44.550 --> 00:12:50.290
I managed to get Stardust 
back, but can I Accel Synchro?

00:12:50.850 --> 00:12:54.430
Can I succeed when I already failed once?

00:12:55.450 --> 00:12:58.770
I can't be scared!  I have to succeed!

00:12:58.770 --> 00:13:01.500
I'll believe in my power and my cards!

00:13:01.730 --> 00:13:03.940
We'll do this together, Stardust!

00:13:06.780 --> 00:13:09.970
You'll find out that you're powerless!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:23.120
What's this?

00:13:35.610 --> 00:13:37.170
A tornado?

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.510
Is everyone in the city safe?

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.640
What's that?

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:48.090
Is Yusei okay?

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:51.980
Mizoguchi!

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:53.090
Miss!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.410
We'll be blown away!

00:13:58.580 --> 00:14:00.410
Everyone, retreat!  Hurry!

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:00.820
Right!

00:14:00.820 --> 00:14:02.880
What's going on?

00:14:09.200 --> 00:14:11.720
I need to get to safety fast!

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:20.160
Help me!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:28.860
Haruka!

00:14:32.410 --> 00:14:34.090
Yusei is fighting.

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:38.970
I can't do anything right now, 
but I'll protect whoever I can.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.090
My cards!

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.290
Be careful!

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:44.870
Haruka!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.070
Haruka!

00:14:49.610 --> 00:14:51.430
Don't let go!

00:14:51.650 --> 00:14:53.640
Sis!

00:14:54.560 --> 00:14:55.570
This is bad!

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:57.360
She'll be blown away!

00:14:57.990 --> 00:14:58.970
What can I do?

00:14:59.420 --> 00:15:01.860
If I could just use my psychic powers...

00:15:05.810 --> 00:15:07.500
What am I thinking?

00:15:07.500 --> 00:15:12.590
I can't rely on that cursed power.

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.330
It's too dangerous!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:16.060
You'll be blown away too!

00:15:24.580 --> 00:15:26.000
Haruka, hang in there!

00:15:26.250 --> 00:15:27.840
Sis!

00:15:32.460 --> 00:15:34.130
Be careful!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.080
You're safe now.

00:15:46.470 --> 00:15:47.930
Sis!

00:15:49.550 --> 00:15:50.670
Haruka!

00:15:51.650 --> 00:15:56.010
I can't give up on her, just like 
how Yusei doesn't give up in battle!

00:15:58.240 --> 00:16:00.250
I won't let go even if I die!

00:16:04.280 --> 00:16:06.240
Well done!

00:16:06.240 --> 00:16:07.590
You're incredible.

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:14.730
I no longer need the cursed power.

00:16:23.810 --> 00:16:25.480
Yusei is inside?

00:16:25.830 --> 00:16:28.240
I can no longer lend him my power.

00:16:28.340 --> 00:16:32.210
You must overcome this 
test on your own, Yusei!

00:16:38.600 --> 00:16:39.940
My turn!

00:16:41.070 --> 00:16:45.640
Destiny already determined that 
you can't defeat Meklord Emperor!

00:16:46.030 --> 00:16:49.350
You're wrong!  You create your own destiny!

00:16:50.350 --> 00:16:54.010
Stop acting superior when you can't 
even use the stone table card.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:59.590
Just keep dancing like a 
bee and draw the Circuit!

00:16:59.790 --> 00:17:01.120
Circuit?

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:07.190
Destiny is a forbidden book that 
only god is allowed to write.

00:17:07.190 --> 00:17:10.270
It's not something you can create!

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:12.830
I don't believe that!

00:17:12.830 --> 00:17:17.760
Every person had free will to create history!

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:22.620
Free will became a huge current 
that caused humanity to evolve!

00:17:22.850 --> 00:17:27.740
And what did these evolved 
people gain in the end?

00:17:28.050 --> 00:17:34.090
It was a tool that led to self-destruction, 
Moment's inventor's son!

00:17:37.300 --> 00:17:42.750
Synchro Summon is humanity's symbol for 
pointlessly trying to increase power!

00:17:42.750 --> 00:17:44.820
No matter how many times you get it back,

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:49.470
your Synchro Monster belongs to Meklord 
Emperor every time it's my turn!

00:17:49.470 --> 00:17:51.830
I activate Meklord Emperor Wisel's effect!

00:17:51.830 --> 00:17:53.610
Stardust is mine!

00:18:00.770 --> 00:18:02.760
I won't let you have Stardust again!

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:09.540
I'll never let that tragedy happen again!

00:18:09.540 --> 00:18:12.670
I promise to protect this 
city with my own hands!

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:21.430
Yusei, win!

00:18:23.240 --> 00:18:24.820
We're with you!

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:27.280
Yusei!

00:18:30.550 --> 00:18:31.640
Yusei.

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:43.750
I have a bond with my friends!

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:58.400
My body melts into the world of speed.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.770
I become one with the wind.

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:16.880
Shooting Star Dragon...

00:19:20.330 --> 00:19:21.770
Clear Mind!

00:19:21.770 --> 00:19:28.540
Level 2 Synchro Tuner Formula Synchron tunes 
Level 8 Synchro Monster Stardust Dragon!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:32.120
What?  You're Synchro Summoning 
during the opponent's turn?

00:19:35.580 --> 00:19:39.760
Dreams crystallize to open 
a new door of evolution!

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:41.670
Become the path that lights the way!

00:19:44.060 --> 00:19:46.250
Accel Synchro!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:50.900
He vanished?

00:19:52.970 --> 00:19:56.570
Arise!  Shooting Star Dragon!

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:29.780
What's this?

00:20:30.050 --> 00:20:34.140
This is my new power!  Shooting Star Dragon!

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.400
It's Yusei's Accel Synchro!

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:44.470
This light...

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:46.980
It's completely different than before.

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:02.290
What's this light?

00:21:02.460 --> 00:21:04.390
It's warm and kind.

00:21:04.390 --> 00:21:06.170
Can it be Yusei?

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:18.550
What should he do?  Something 
dangerous has appeared.

00:21:18.820 --> 00:21:22.520
Interesting.  God gave him that card.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:29.200
God's destiny surpasses our predictions.

00:21:29.200 --> 00:21:34.580
Let's see what lies ahead.

00:21:35.320 --> 00:21:37.480
Let's go, Shooting Star!

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:56.290
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:21:56.760 --> 00:22:03.000
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you

00:22:15.950 --> 00:22:21.250
You always pretend and hide your fears

00:22:21.590 --> 00:22:26.890
You act tough and don't listen to anyone

00:22:27.190 --> 00:22:32.500
You do this over and over

00:22:32.860 --> 00:22:38.200
I shouted until my soul would break

00:22:38.470 --> 00:22:43.610
Hurry up and throw that away

00:22:44.140 --> 00:22:51.120
We're only heading towards tomorrow

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:56.850
Close to you   If you're 
trying to find yourself

00:22:57.260 --> 00:23:02.690
Just keep doing what you ultimately decided

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:08.130
Close to you  Keep what's 
precious in your heart

00:23:08.630 --> 00:23:16.240
There's only one shining 
soul that's next to you
